WEBVTT

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.130
Shem-ha, your plan is finished!

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.970
There's no point in resisting further!

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.060
Spite...

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.910
But, Enki...

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.170
You may be right.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.510
Then...!

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.630
Therefore...!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.560
Pleasure.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.880
You have always stood in my way.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:08.490
If I can take you out myself, 
that's good enough for me.

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:10.090
<i>At this rate...</i>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:18.060
You sacrificed your arm 
to save your life?

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:42.640
Then I... will sacrifice 
my life to gain the future.

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.920
Farewell, Enki.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:59.840
Now if I can just activate 
the network jammer...

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.900
I'm sorry, Finé...

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.220
What was that?

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.650
No way! Are we...

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.350
Tsubasa!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.250
Tsubasa!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:04.430
<b>Episode 11
In The Beginning Was The Word</b>

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.870
The moon?!

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.170
Yes.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:10.090
We've detected the Gears' signals from 
the lunar surface, so they are on the moon.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.770
If the Alchemists' teleportation 
spell took them there...

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.820
If they really are there,
 the issue at hand...

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:22.860
Is finding a way to bring them back.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.920
There's air. It's clean, actually.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.950
And gravity identical to Earth.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.090
We can assume this environment 
is being artificially maintained.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.880
It's not like you to be reckless.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.070
Maria, what was I to do?

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.940
I don't know.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:55.600
Yeah. Have courage, maybe.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.600
Courage?

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:03.610
When you didn't take the hand she 
offered, I'm sure she felt sad.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:08.170
But she summoned up the 
courage to take yours.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.330
Tachibana...

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.630
I think it's your turn to answer her courage.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.150
You're right.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:20.820
Like a coward, I pushed
 her hand away, and—

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:21.910
Ow!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.390
My goodness, you're ridiculous sometimes.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:29.440
For now, let's find the others.

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:31.940
What?!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.620
Maria, what is that light?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.200
The Airgetlám is guiding us?

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.370
Let's go.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.920
The damage to the gem that 
would take me back is extensive.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.340
I can't use it.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.050
<i>The load of bringing the Symphogears with me</i>

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.130
<i>may have exceeded its expected range.</i>

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:04.620
<i>Or...</i>

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.390
Who's there?

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.500
Elza-chan?

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.840
You're safe!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:18.300
Yeah, but the backfire blew 
out my neuron connectors.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:22.310
I don't think I can use the 
tail attachment anymore.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.020
Yeah.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.060
But I'm glad you're okay.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.040
Let's find Millaarc-chan.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.510
Right.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.000
A warning?!

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:47.770
It's the ruins, trying to 
eliminate us as intruders.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.030
We saw that shape at the South Pole!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:02.100
Yeah, they're definitely 
a precursor civilization.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.490
We're done running.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.530
Let's break through, Chris-chan!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:19.740
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:04.250
<i>I swear to protect someone, but...</i>

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.510
<i>I just have two hands, what if 
they're not good enough someday?</i>

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:15.170
<i>Even when I'm afraid, I can't stop</i>

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:13.370
We've detected Gungnir's signal 
in the lunar ruins again!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.710
Ichaival, as well!

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.490
We've detected Shirabe-chan and 
Kirika-chan's signals, as well.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:21.290
<i>Time continues cruelly towards the future!</i>

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.800
But they're not responding to our hails.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.090
Guys...

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:26.870
<i>When I make that decision, am I truly me?</i>

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.870
They're probably engaged in 
combat at the lunar ruins.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.770
And what concerns me...

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:30.730
Is that we haven't seen Tsubasa-san 
and Maria-san's signals, right?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.710
<i>Please tell me! Please tell me!</i>

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:34.920
<i>But just for now, take a step forward!</i>

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.630
Keep hailing them,

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:34.940
and request help from 
the world's governments!

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:39.120
<i>Let today be the spark that ignites tomorrow</i>

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:38.000
Get us a way to the moon as fast as possible!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:44.550
<i>Live so you won't regret your choices</i>

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:47.450
We're lucky we were the ones 
who ended up on the moon.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.050
<i>Live now! Live now! You're not done yet!</i>

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.930
<i>Something still burns within you</i>

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:51.290
The special forces team 
wouldn't have stood a chance.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:55.730
<i>Let the fear of the power and its 
possibilities burn bright in your heart</i>

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:57.540
I have the data on the ruins' 
layout downloaded from Shem-ha.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:58.900
<i>And believe in the flame!</i>

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.270
But she didn't tell me how 
to deal with its defenses...

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:08.890
Releasing humanity from its 
curse is tougher than I thought.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.730
<i>Breaking the Curse of Balal...</i>

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>If people could really 
understand each other, then...</i>

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.330
<i>The one who's doing what's right is...</i>

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.370
Chris-chan!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.590
They're a mass-produced version 
of the guy at the South Pole?

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.830
<i>Can you hear me (Burnin'!)</i>

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.790
<i>Heart (Burnin'!) Soul (Burnin'!) This song!</i>

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:39.000
<i>No weight will dwell in a fist without hesitation</i>

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:44.740
<i>Just hold the answer that connects in your hands</i>

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.720
<i>Shine, pulse of life</i>

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:50.300
<i>What will it teach me?</i>

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.720
<i>Where will it ring?</i>

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.350
We broke through, Chris-chan.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.170
You're too cool at times, 
with that crazy power of yours.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.310
Shaking with ecstasy.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:18.300
The roots of Yggdrasil have already spread 
to all the core portions of Earth.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:22.850
And when the monsters 
fulfill their duty, I...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.320
You struggle so much.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.630
A miracle made possible 
by your strong feelings?

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.310
Because I still need to talk to Hibiki!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.960
Inexplicable.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.630
It was you who took me in.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.780
Who was it who wanted to connect with others,

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.320
to let them know how they felt?

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:48.590
No! That was... I...

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.340
Offer me your body and heart...

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:57.080
My vessel, the girl who was first 
to be released from the curse...

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.790
I am Shem-ha.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.800
The coming future of this planet.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:07.410
Your name means the same, does it not?

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.420
Hibiki!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.250
Something's happening with Yggdrasil!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.070
Contact HQ!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.820
No, we may need to return to base.

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:27.550
Right!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.910
Maria, look!

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:37.040
Yes. It seems to point to this place.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:45.770
What do we do?

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.640
Let's accept the invitation.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.870
This is the lunar surface. We can't 
get anywhere if we don't jump in.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.500
This strange room... 
It seems to be the ruins' core.

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:14.880
It stopped!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.310
Maria!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.590
Wait. I saw him in my dream.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:22.680
Your dream?

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.270
What's he trying to tell us?

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:36.880
I've attempted to tune my language to match 
the patterns observed within the facility.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.270
Does this work?

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.740
Who are you?

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:46.740
I am an operating system based 
on the mind of the original Enki.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:50.320
Enki? Shem-ha said that name.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.490
This is observation base Mardock.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:56.970
The core of the network jammer Balal.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.000
My echolocation is picking up 
two moving bodies.

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.410
I hope it's Vanessa and Elza.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.900
We're currently east of the 
Kii Peninsula, moving at 30 km/h.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.900
Unknown message incoming.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.430
Identifying source.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.680
Is this... the moon?

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.140
Onscreen!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:23.600
<i>This is Tsubasa! Maria is with me!</i>

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.560
You're safe!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.570
But how are you contacting us?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.030
We've entered the control room,

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.530
and established a communications 
link between HQ and the ruins.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.290
We've removed the restrictions 
on communications,

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.490
as well as disabled part 
of the defense system.

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:38.950
We've contacted the others
 who were hiding,

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.420
and they are on their way here.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:46.790
<i>Yggdrasil has activated and we're 
on our way to deal with it.</i>

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.640
It's already active?

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.340
Yggdrasil...

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:55.450
It seems that World Tree 
is nastier than it appears.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.820
Impossible!

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:02.410
Then the reason that Shem-ha 
looked down on us as tools...

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.640
Correct.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:13.690
Humanity's brain, not their physical 
abilities, was strengthened,

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:18.870
in order to allow them to function as 
a biological calculation terminal group

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.990
for the Yggdrasil planetary 
environmental modification group.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.990
This fact should be clear if you 
travel back through Earth's history.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:30.780
On this planet, we created life,

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.360
promoted evolution,

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:35.200
and modified that life in 
accordance with our goals.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.450
Humanity is a product 
of that process, as well.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:44.130
But one of our own, 
the Modification Surgeon Shem-Ha,

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.940
revolted in pursuit of power and authority,

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.280
and challenged us to battle.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.470
By transforming herself into a language,

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:59.920
Shem-ha became capable of lurking within 
every system, and thus impossible to destroy.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:05.000
With no other choice, we decided 
to seal Shem-Ha and abandon Earth.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.410
Seal Shem-ha?

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.220
In that bracelet?!

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:13.090
No. Shem-ha is now a data fragment,

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:18.050
which continues to exist within all 
of humanity's genetic information.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:23.420
Impossible... Then all of humanity 
is a cradle for Shem-ha?

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.440
No matter how many times she's defeated,

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.570
she will regenerate from the data fragment,

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.440
giving her de-facto immortality.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:36.250
Thus, we created the network jammer Balal,

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:39.610
to separate humanity, which was 
united by its one language,

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.840
and thus succeeded in sealing her.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.920
So you're saying the Curse of Balal...

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:49.730
...is the source of discord, 
but has also protected humanity!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:55.480
<i>Now that she's revived, Shem-ha will 
attempt to remove the Curse of Balal</i>

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:59.420
<i>and, using humanity as biological terminals,</i>

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:04.780
<i>will turn the planet and all its life into 
monsters that she can control with Yggdrasil.</i>

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:08.020
<i>So her goal is the destruction 
of the lunar ruins.</i>

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.240
<i>But if we can prevent that...</i>

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.980
I guess I shouldn't be surprised by S.O.N.G.

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:15.740
You've got it all figured out.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:18.860
Noble Red?!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:29.810
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:17.010
<i>I just need to protect the places close to me</i>

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:21.680
<i>It's all I can do</i>

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:25.060
Tsubasa-san and Maria-san appear 
to be in combat within the ruins.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:24.690
<i>It's because I am so weak</i>

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:32.940
<i>That I was happy just to grab 
the happiness I could see</i>

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:28.560
We're trying to find a way to 
get you back from the moon!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.720
<i>We'll get you home, so just 
hang in there! Survive!</i>

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:39.290
<i>But the wind called time 
doesn't just heal my wounds</i>

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:39.420
If they're starting now, how long 
will it take them to get to the moon?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:48.830
<i>The world said "the possibilities 
are endless" and pushed me forward.</i>

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.620
A week? A month?

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.920
Unlike monsters, humans...

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:48.450
won't last three days without water!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:55.560
<i>As long as I have a sky to howl "damn!" to</i>

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:56.080
Even if I live 100,000 lives, 
 I'll never again...

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:59.400
<i>No matter what enemy tramples me down</i>

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.380
Fine!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:01.370
Now that I'm a monster, I don't need tricks!

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.360
<i>Even if my arm breaks</i>

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:06.380
<i>Then I'll punch them with the broken arm</i>

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.910
<i>It's okay if I lose to the enemy</i>

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:09.450
Maria!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:17.280
<i>Not losing to myself is my fire</i>

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:18.710
Open Bat!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.620
Impossible!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:27.120
And there's more than that 
to the Grand Guignol!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.330
We can use unison, too, you know!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:37.300
The lunar surface tag 
battle's about to begin!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:40.250
Something we can't even imagine 
must be happening on the moon.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:50.890
Gotcha!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.360
Simultaneous attacks...

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.130
But we can do that, too!

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.440
Remember the first time we sang together!

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:06.690
The song that connected us!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:14.170
Noble Red destroyed my pride.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:18.040
But pride always returns.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.170
It rises up from within the flames!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:27.190
Let's see you expose your bare self, 
glistening on the battlefield!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.730
<i>3,2,1, ready go fight?</i>

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.110
<i>This endless, strong emotion</i>

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.280
<i>This strong emotion I'll never give up</i>

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:41.860
<i>An immortal melody that can't be defeated</i>

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.630
We've passed Omaezaki.

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.330
We're about to reach the operation point.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:48.330
<i>Shine, true heart!</i>

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:47.230
Tsubasa-san, Maria-san, we're going 
to hit Yggdrasil with everything we've got.

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:48.330
So...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.330
We'll come back! We promise!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.240
Until then, keep Earth safe!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:58.050
<i>The heartbeat that gives life 
slipped and fell from my hand</i>

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:04.300
<i>What does the shattered moonlight 
ask those left behind?</i>

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:08.120
This is my full power, with added 
strength from the screw attack!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.820
Time to spin!

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:12.460
And we've also included our 
feelings for Vanessa and Elza,

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:16.000
our rage and sorrow, 
and a lot of other feelings,

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.070
and it's time to explode!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.230
<i>Ignition.</i>

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:31.210
<i>Burn! There is no such thing as destiny.</i>

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:34.380
<i>Fly! And rip apart your cage.</i>

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.800
<i>Go! Flapping our wings passionately</i>

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:38.550
<i>And resounding to share</i>

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.340
<i>Playing our music to share</i>

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.800
<i>The bonds between us!</i>

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.380
<i>That's right, hold our tears in close</i>

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.760
<i>Holding close all the burdens we bore</i>

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.840
Open Bat!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.470
<i>We'll turn our immortal dreams into wings</i>

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:47.880
But this is...?!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:56.150
<i>So will you fly to tomorrow with me?</i>

00:20:56.150 --> 00:21:02.150
<i>Sing, Phoenix Song!</i>

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.690
<b>Highest Good Rose Cross</b>

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:12.820
Maria! Tsubasa-san!

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:17.260
Was that incredible impact your song?

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.140
We'll talk later.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.130
First, I need to report.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.420
HQ, can you hear me?

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:30.360
Part of the port side was damaged 
from an external attack!

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:32.030
We're taking on water!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.580
Yggdrasil is everywhere!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.340
Not just the one in Kamakura!

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:40.000
Yggdrasil is all over the world!

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.430
Thrilling!

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:53.850
Now, with Yggdrasil, 
I will change all things.

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:56.970
Chris-chan, look!

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.870
Our home...

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.500
What's going on?

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:05.760
It seems it's begun.
